explore  if you're not sure what to do with your  life if you're not sure what business  you want to run if you have a  uncertainty in your life  explore  don't put so much pressure on yourself  to find the right thing the perfect  thing right away because  that's not usually how things happen  you have to give yourself the chance to  explore  try things out  see what works see what you enjoy  if you don't like it quit go do  something else if you like something  keep going and see where it leads  this comes as a result of a question  from nick who's one of my youtube  viewers love you guys  wrote the long email now nick guys you  got to shorten up the emails i love that  you're kind of pouring your hearts out  but this takes time to read  anyway nick is 19 years old and is  unsure what to do next okay he's a  business major he loves technology he  loves business he loves the internet he  loves staying on top of tech trends and  he's unsure what to do next what do i do  next  nick don't put so much pressure on  yourself okay  just explore  so maybe that means going to get a job  at a tech company maybe that means  starting up some kind of business  website or tech resource yourself see  what's missing in the world  and try to make something or try to  learn something by working at another  business  and see if you enjoy it  if you're not sure what your passion is  try different things out  something will stick  and don't put so much pressure you have  to find the right thing right away a  while ago i took art classes okay it's  like i got to do something different i  want to i want to explore something new  so i said okay i'm going to do art  classes  and i kind of forced myself to go to  these art classes and  i wasn't very good  but i just wasn't enjoying it and for  some reason i kept going like i got to  get good at this  i was desperate to find something new  to explore  and forced it on this art class that  wasn't the right thing the art class was  not for me  i i left it i didn't sign up again  because i just wasn't having fun  and then earlier this year  i guess last year i took up snowboarding  i just went i went one day snowboarding  i'd never done it before and you know  what i loved it  i fell in love with snowboarding and i  started picking it up and started going  more frequently and getting better at it  so it's the same thing with finding a  business idea or finding your passion  don't force it on  i really want to go work at samsung so  i'm going to i'm going to go get this  job or i really want to be an  entrepreneur and then this has to be my  business it has to work out if you don't  have that vision you have to find it for  yourself  and you don't find it until you start to  explore  i'm reminded of steve jobs the founder  of apple he went to university and he  was he was bored like it wasn't for him  he didn't know what to do  and he's he dropped out of his classes  he dropped he officially dropped out of  university and instead  started dropping in on classes about  typography  fonts  and if you look at that from an outside  world you think steve what are you like  are you crazy what are you doing  you're dropping out of school  where you can go and get a real job out  of and get hired and make money and  survive  and instead of doing that  you're you're dropping in on classes  where you don't get a credit for to  learn about  writing and fonts are you crazy  and he didn't know what he was doing  either  okay at that time it wasn't all mapped  out for him he didn't know what he was  doing  but when he actually led to create apple  the thing that made apple different was  their fonts  apple had lots of different fonts where  all their competitors didn't  and that came because steve jobs had a  passion for fonts and sat in on those  classes  the point is you don't know how the dots  are going to connect you cannot plot  this thing you can't say this this is  this and i'm a success  you can't force yourself to do something  that you don't enjoy and love doing  if you try you will not be successful  so explore  find what excites you find what's your  what your passion is what you're excited  about  and then stick with that  and have the courage to leave something  that you don't like that's where most  people fall down they get stuck on a  career path that they realize more and  more that they hate but they're too  afraid to leave it to do something new  because they don't even know what to do  they don't know what that new thing is  so you stick on this mediocre life  you have to have the courage  to leave  the good the okay the mediocre  for something great even if you don't  know what that looks like yet  so start exploring  believe  for those of you watching you liked the  video please give it a thumbs up below  it always makes you want to do more and  let me know what you think leave a  comment underneath you have a question  leave it below i'll do a video response  for you thank you so much  and i'll see you soon

